  "metaDescription": "Markets react as President Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva considers Bradesco's Luiz Trabuco for a government role amid ongoing cabinet restructuring plans.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva has approached Bradesco chairman Luiz Trabuco to potentially join the upcoming 2027 government cabinet.",
